9. FULL FEATURE SPECIFICATIONS
Feature 1: Payment Processing (Stripe)
Description: Integrate Stripe Checkout for seamless payments
Technical Details:
Use Stripe Checkout (hosted page)
Create payment link for each prompt tier
Pass metadata: {email, promptId, price}
Webhook endpoint to capture checkout.session.completed
Store purchase in KV store: email:promptId → true
Acceptance Criteria:
✅ Payment completes in <60s
✅ Supports all major cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex)
✅ Mobile-friendly checkout
✅ Webhook fires 100% of the time
✅ No duplicate charges
Edge Cases:
User refreshes during checkout → Resume session
Payment fails → Show error + retry button
Webhook delayed → Poll status after 30s

Feature 2: Email-Based Auth (Magic Links)
Description: Passwordless authentication via email magic links
Technical Details:
User enters email
Generate JWT token (expires in 24h)
Send email with link: /auth?token=XXX
Verify token on click → Set session cookie (30 days)
Session stored in localStorage
Acceptance Criteria:
✅ Email sent within 30s
✅ Link works on any device
✅ Expired links show clear error
✅ No password required
Security:
JWT signed with secret key
Rate limit: 3 emails per hour per IP
Token single-use (burns after first click)

Feature 3: Prompt Unlock System
Description: Display purchased prompt with copy/download options
Technical Details:
Fetch prompt from JSON file or backend
Render Markdown (code blocks, bold, lists)
Copy button uses navigator.clipboard.writeText()
Download PDF uses jsPDF library
Mobile responsive (readable on small screens)
Acceptance Criteria:
✅ Prompt loads instantly (<1s)
✅ Copy button works 100% of the time
✅ PDF includes branding (logo, footer)
✅ Markdown renders correctly

Feature 4: Share-to-Unlock (Prompt 3)
Description: Unlock Prompt 3 by sharing to 3 platforms
Technical Details:
Share buttons for Twitter, LinkedIn, Reddit
Each share opens native share dialog with pre-filled text
Track shares via URL param: ?ref=user123
Backend endpoint: /api/track-share?user=XX&platform=XX
After 3 unique shares → Unlock prompt
Prevent cheating: Check Referer header, rate limit
Acceptance Criteria:
✅ Share buttons work on mobile
✅ Tracks shares accurately
✅ Unlocks after 3 shares
✅ Cannot game system (refresh = no count)

