11. API BLUEPRINT
Endpoints
1. Create Checkout Session
POST /api/create-checkout
Request:
{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "promptId": 4
}

Response:
{
  "checkoutUrl": "https://checkout.stripe.com/c/pay/cs_test_xxx"
}

Auth: None (public)

2. Stripe Webhook
POST /api/webhook/stripe
Request (from Stripe):
{
  "type": "checkout.session.completed",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "customer_email": "alex@example.com",
      "metadata": {
        "promptId": "4"
      }
    }
  }
}

Response:
{
  "received": true
}

Auth: Stripe signature verification
Actions:
Store purchase in KV
Send confirmation email with magic link

3. Send Magic Link
POST /api/send-magic-link
Request:
{
  "email": "alex@example.com"
}

Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Check your email"
}

Auth: None (rate limited)

4. Verify Magic Link
GET /api/verify-token?token=XXX
Response:
{
  "valid": true,
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "purchases": [4, 5, 6]
}

Auth: None (token is secret)

5. Get Prompt Content
GET /api/prompt/:id?email=XXX
Response:
{
  "id": 4,
  "content": "[Full prompt here]",
  "unlocked": true
}

Auth: Email must have purchased this prompt
Error Cases:
403: Prompt not purchased
404: Invalid prompt ID

6. Track Share
POST /api/track-share
Request:
{
  "email": "alex@example.com",
