21. SECURITY GUIDELINES + PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATION
Security
Payment Security:
✅ Never store card numbers (Stripe handles)
✅ Use HTTPS only (enforced by Vercel)
✅ Verify webhook signatures (prevent spoofing)
✅ Rate limit payment endpoints (prevent abuse)
Auth Security:
✅ JWT tokens expire in 24h
✅ Tokens are single-use (burned after first click)
✅ Email rate limiting (3 per hour per IP)
✅ Session cookies are HttpOnly + Secure
Data Security:
✅ Encrypt emails in KV store
✅ No PII in logs
✅ GDPR-compliant (user data export/delete)
✅ Regular backups (Vercel KV auto-backups)
API Security:
✅ CORS configured (only allow your domain)
✅ Input validation (email format, prompt IDs)
✅ SQL injection prevention (use ORMs)
✅ XSS prevention (sanitize user input)
Performance Optimization
