23. RISKS & MITIGATION STRATEGIES
Risk 1: Payment Webhook Fails
Impact: User pays but doesn't get access
 Probability: Medium
 Mitigation:
Implement retry logic (3 attempts)
Poll Stripe API after 30s if webhook missing
Manual reconciliation dashboard for admins
Refund process for failed unlocks
Risk 2: Low Conversion Rate (<3%)
Impact: No revenue, project fails
 Probability: High (typical for new sites)
 Mitigation:
A/B test headlines/pricing
Add social proof (testimonials)
Create demo video
Offer money-back guarantee
Add urgency (limited-time discount)
Risk 3: Prompt Content Leaked
Impact: Users share prompts publicly
 Probability: High
 Mitigation:
Watermark prompts with buyer email
DMCA takedown process
Regular monitoring (search Twitter/Reddit)
Accept some leakage (inevitable)
Risk 4: Stripe Account Suspended
Impact: Can't accept payments
 Probability: Low (if following ToS)
 Mitigation:
Follow Stripe guidelines (clear refund policy)
Keep Gumroad as backup
Diversify payment methods
Maintain good customer support
Risk 5: Server Costs Exceed Revenue
Impact: Lose money on hosting
 Probability: Low (Vercel free tier generous)
 Mitigation:
Monitor Vercel usage dashboard
Optimize API calls (cache aggressively)
Upgrade plan only after $100/month revenue
Risk 6: No Traffic/Marketing
Impact: Nobody visits the site
 Probability: High (no brand awareness)
 Mitigation:
Product Hunt launch (free exposure)
Reddit posts (non-spammy, value-first)
Twitter threads (build in public)
SEO optimization (long-term)

